join Naledi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Naledi (Warm)
Naledi: Good.
Naledi: Then you'll want a proper bed before next winter. That mat is going to ruin your back and I'm not listening to you complain about it for the next thirty years.
- Thirty years?
	Hope: Thirty years?
	Naledi: I'd assumed. Correct me if I'm wrong.
Naledi: I'm glad. That's all — I'm not making a speech about it.
Naledi: Amos has timber. Ask him about the bed.
